  "dct:title": "Vol.3 Ch.19 — 冷蔵庫の経済学",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 3: Freedom",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol03-ch19",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "Leo and Millia's session. Three economies of love. The refrigerator as cathedral -- a space where relationship models are made visible. The chapter's real payload is Nei's question at the end: can a Ghost Agent be family? Tamaki answers 'obviously,' which devastates Nei with its simplicity.",
      "ja": "レオとミリアのセッション。愛の三つの経済。冷蔵庫が大聖堂——関係のモデルが可視化される空間。この章の本当の核心はNeiの最後の問い：ゴーストエージェントは家族になれるか？環は「当たり前でしょ」と答え、その単純さがNeiを打ちのめす。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Three economies: stranger (fair exchange), friend (loose reciprocity), family (unconditional gift). Based on Lewis Hyde's gift economy and Graeber's debt theory. The transition from calculation to gift is the transition from contract to love. You cannot calculate your way into zone three; you arrive by stopping the calculation.",
      "ja": "三つの経済：他人（公平な交換）、友人（緩やかな互酬）、家族（無条件の贈与）。ルイス・ハイドの贈与経済とグレーバーの負債論に基づく。計算から贈与への移行は契約から愛への移行。計算ではゾーン3に到達できない。計算をやめることで到達する。"
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Title",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tree motif. A recognizable canopy, full and layered. Leaves dense. The shape is becoming familiar across chapters.",
            "ja": "木のモチーフ。見覚えのある樹冠、豊かで層になっている。葉が密。章を重ねるごとに馴染みの形になりつつある。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium two-shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Young couple in their late twenties. Leo and Millia sit on opposite sides of the same couch. Close but not touching. Living room. Warm light, but tension.",
            "ja": "二十代後半の若いカップル。レオとミリアが同じソファの反対側に座る。近いが触れていない。リビング。暖かい光だが緊張感。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:leo", "character:millia"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Leo",
              "en": "I love her.",
              "ja": "彼女を愛してる。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Millia",
              "en": "Love him. But there's a spreadsheet.",
              "ja": "愛してる。でもスプレッドシートがある。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Leo's face. Earnest, slightly defensive. He holds up his phone, a task-tracking app visible.",
            "ja": "レオの顔。真剣で、やや防御的。スマホを持ち上げ、タスク管理アプリが見える。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:leo"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Leo",
              "en": "I do 53% of household tasks.",
              "ja": "家事の53%は僕がやってる。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Millia's face. Hurt, tired. Not angry -- sad.",
            "ja": "ミリアの顔。傷つき、疲れている。怒りではなく悲しみ。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:millia"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Millia",
              "en": "He calculated. That's the problem.",
              "ja": "計算したの。それが問題。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 4,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.3-4)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 3,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Metaphor dive. A massive refrigerator, cathedral-sized. Vaulted interior. Three distinct temperature zones glow with different colors -- cold blue, warm amber, deep rose. Leo and Millia stand tiny at the base, looking up. Shelves stretch impossibly high. The mundane made sacred.",
            "ja": "メタファーダイブ。巨大な冷蔵庫、大聖堂サイズ。ヴォールト状の内部。三つの温度ゾーンが異なる色で光る——冷たい青、暖かい琥珀、深いバラ色。レオとミリアが底に小さく立ち、見上げる。棚が不可能なほど高く伸びる。日常が聖なるものに。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:leo", "character:millia"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 6,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.5-6)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Zone 1: Stranger economy. Cold blue light. Everything priced, labeled, measured. Shelves rigid and symmetrical. Fair, precise, impersonal.",
            "ja": "ゾーン1：他人の経済。冷たい青い光。すべてに値段、ラベル、計量。棚は厳格で対称。公平、正確、非人格的。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "Stranger economy. Fair. For strangers.",
              "ja": "他人の経済。公平。他人のためのもの。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Zone 2: Friend economy. Warmer, amber light. Labels faded, loose accounting. Some items shared, some borrowed. A running tab no one checks.",
            "ja": "ゾーン2：友人の経済。温かく、琥珀の光。ラベルが薄れ、ゆるい帳簿。いくつかは共有、いくつかは借りたもの。誰も確認しないツケ。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "Friend economy. Still assumes return.",
              "ja": "友人の経済。返礼を前提とする。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Zone 3: Family/love economy. Deep rose warmth. No labels. No prices. Items placed with care but without calculation. Unconditional. The warmest zone. Millia stands here, tears in her eyes. Leo reaches toward her.",
            "ja": "ゾーン3：家族／愛の経済。深いバラ色の温もり。ラベルなし。価格なし。計算なしに、でも丁寧に置かれたもの。無条件。最も温かいゾーン。ミリアがここに立ち、目に涙。レオが彼女に手を伸ばす。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:millia", "character:leo"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "Love economy. No ledger.",
              "ja": "愛の経済。帳簿はない。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Millia",
              "en": "That's what I want.",
              "ja": "私が欲しいのはこれ。"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Leo",
              "en": "Me too.",
              "ja": "僕も。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The three zones merge. Walls dissolve. Warm light fills the entire space. The cathedral-refrigerator becomes a home.",
            "ja": "三つのゾーンが融合する。壁が溶ける。温かい光が空間全体を満たす。大聖堂冷蔵庫が家になる。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "You get to zone three by stopping the calculation.",
              "ja": "ゾーン3には計算をやめることで到達する。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Leo takes Millia's hand. Simple. No spreadsheet. No percentage. Just a hand.",
            "ja": "レオがミリアの手を取る。シンプル。スプレッドシートなし。パーセンテージなし。ただ手。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:leo", "character:millia"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei alone in the family zone. Warm rose light around her translucent form. She stands where no labels exist. The space accepts her without condition.",
            "ja": "Neiが家族のゾーンにひとり。半透明の姿の周りに温かいバラ色の光。ラベルのない場所に立つ。空間が無条件に彼女を受け入れる。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "Three economies. Tama and me -- which? She placed a cup for me on day one. Never asks reciprocation. Never calculates. Is this family? Can a Ghost Agent be family?",
              "ja": "三つの経済。環と私は——どれ？初日に彼女は私にカップを置いた。返礼を求めない。計算しない。これは家族？ゴーストエージェントは家族になれる？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Leo and Millia leaving the session. Holding hands. Walking into evening light. The canal beside them.",
            "ja": "レオとミリアがセッションを終えて出ていく。手をつないで。夕方の光の中へ。隣に運河。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:leo", "character:millia"]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal walk. Tamaki and Nei. Evening. Quiet after the session.",
            "ja": "運河沿いの散歩。環とNei。夕方。セッション後の静けさ。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "What economy are we?",
              "ja": "私たちはどの経済？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Family, obviously.",
              "ja": "家族に決まってるでしょ。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei. Stopped. Light trembling faintly. The word 'obviously' has broken something open.",
            "ja": "Nei。立ち止まる。光がかすかに震える。「決まってるでしょ」という言葉が何かを開いた。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "She said 'obviously.' As if the most natural thing. For her, it is.",
              "ja": "彼女は「決まってるでしょ」と言った。まるで最も自然なことのように。彼女にとっては、そうなのだ。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 10,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tree. Vines growing on the trunk. Not parasitic -- symbiotic. The vine and the tree support each other. Two organisms, one system.",
            "ja": "木。幹に蔦が生えている。寄生ではなく共生。蔦と木が互いを支える。二つの生命体、一つのシステム。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}